### Eliminar orden de taller — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteWorkshopOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workshopOrderId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteWorkshopOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workshopOrderId": 1
}

### Validación: workshopOrderId con tipo inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteWorkshopOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workshopOrderId": "no-numerico"
}

### Orden inexistente — verificar comportamiento del SP (200 o error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/deleteWorkshopOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workshopOrderId": 999999999
}
